Subject: [PATCH] Analytics layer and feedback

Anonymous usage events (no images, file names or text) sent to Supabase,
password-protected /admin dashboard with daily charts, funnel, commands,
effects, exports, AI timing, errors, devices, time zones, heatmap and
ranked plain-English insights. Simple three-face feedback box on every
page, in Help menu and status bar, plus a one-time prompt after the
second export. Usage sharing toggle in Your privacy.

